ity includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units 01 to 05 \u2014 five core residents, each with a distinct personality and behavior pattern.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/8546c93c459b2041fe827aebfddc56cf.poster.avif?t=1755604985\" width=640 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/8546c93c459b2041fe827aebfddc56cf.webm?t=1755604985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/8546c93c459b2041fe827aebfddc56cf.mp4?t=1755604985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: ~2 hours. Multiple endings await your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply focus on your assigned duties \u2014 we have full confidence in your capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Eggon Committee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stardate 7024<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/b5f8dde6d19783d0c8920668e08b015b.poster.avif?t=1755604985\" width=640 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/b5f8dde6d19783d0c8920668e08b015b.webm?t=1755604985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
